    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on middesumeres m\u00e6sse\u00e6fen. \u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g to \u00feam ymbrene \u00e6r mydda wyntran. \u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g to \u00feam ylcan f\u00e6stene. \u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on mydsumeres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g. \u00d0is sceal on mydde wyntres m\u00e6ssennyht to \u00fe\u00e6re forman m\u00e6ssan. \u00d0is sceal on \u00feone ehto\u00f0an m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g to myddan wyntra. \u00d0is sceal on \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g betweox mydde wintres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge and twelftan d\u00e6ge. \u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on s\u00e6ternd\u00e6g to \u00e6wf\u00e6stene \u00e6r myddan wyntra. \u00d0is sceal on \u00feone \u00feryddan \u00feunresd\u00e6g innan lenctene and to pentecosten on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g. \u00d0is sceal on \u00feone syxtan sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten. \u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan. \u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone fiftan sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten. \u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone seofenteo\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten. \u00d0is godspel sceal to \u00feam ymbrene innan h\u00e6rfeste on friged\u00e6g. \u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan to \u00feam ymbrene. \u00d0ys sceal on \u00feunresd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan. \u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan to \u00feam ymbrene. \u00d0is godspel sceal to anes apostoles m\u00e6ssan. \u00d0is sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re feowerteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pent",
